/target

# Cargo.lock is committed on purpose. this is an application rather than a
# library, and one of its dependencies needs an exact version to build at all:
# librespot-core 0.8.0's build script does not compile against vergen 9.1.0, so
# the lock holds 9.0.6. without it a fresh clone resolves forward and fails.

# run artifacts: library dumps, caches, resume state, reports and the music itself
/out
*.log
